# The build stage copies only go.mod, go.sum, cmd/ and internal/, so nothing
# listed here could reach a layer anyway. This is the second lock: it keeps the
# files out of the context uploaded to the daemon.

# Key material and configuration. *.pem covers server_key.pem, which
# rsakey.LoadOrGenerate writes into the working directory of a local run.
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# Full history — anything ever committed and later removed comes back with it.
.git

# Local-only and agent-runtime directories; the latter can hold credentials.
bin/
plans/
.claude/
.multica/
